-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §128 מבנה שבוע העבודה של יועצים חינוכיים: an
-- educational counsellor works an academic teacher's week, the frontal
-- hours divided by the principal between teaching and counselling, the
-- individual hours counselling, and the stay hours serving the role too;
-- and teaches at least a sixth of the position, and at least 4 frontal
-- hours for each share of a position.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `128 מבנה שבוע העבודה של יועצים חינוכיים`

DECLARE `counsellor's hour` IS ONE OF `frontal teaching`, `counselling`, `stay`

-- (א)(1)–(3): the frontal hours are split by the principal between
-- teaching and counselling; the individual hours are counselling; the stay
-- hours are a teacher's, serving the counselling role as well.
@ref akn:art_128__para_a akn:art_128__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_128__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_128__para_a__subpara_3
GIVEN w IS A `work week`, `frontal hours the principal sets for counselling` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `counselling hours in the week` w `frontal hours the principal sets for counselling` IS
    min (w's `frontal hours`) `frontal hours the principal sets for counselling` PLUS w's `individual hours`

-- (ב): at least a sixth of the position in frontal teaching in primary and
-- junior high schools (6 of a full position's 36 hours), "ובכל אופן לא
-- פחות מ- 4 שעות פרונטאליות לכל שיעור משרה". F-ofek-hadash-base-128-a: read
-- as 4 hours for each full position, in proportion, the floor never binds
-- (a sixth of 36 is 6, above 4, at every position); read as 4 hours
-- whatever the share of the position, it binds below two-thirds of one. The
-- reading adopted (convention reading.every-word): the second, under which
-- the words do something.
@ref akn:art_128__para_b
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a counsellor's least frontal teaching hours` `position fraction` IS
    max (36 TIMES `position fraction` DIVIDED BY 6) 4

-- The other reading, for the finding's evidence: 4 for each full position.
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the least hours, 4 in proportion` `position fraction` IS
    max (36 TIMES `position fraction` DIVIDED BY 6) (4 TIMES `position fraction`)

`read in proportion, the 4-hour floor never binds` MEANS
    all (GIVEN k YIELD `the least hours, 4 in proportion` (k DIVIDED BY 100) EQUALS 36 TIMES (k DIVIDED BY 100) DIVIDED BY 6) (range 1 100)
#ASSERT `read in proportion, the 4-hour floor never binds`

#ASSERT `a counsellor's least frontal teaching hours` 1 EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `a counsellor's least frontal teaching hours` 0.5 EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `counselling hours in the week` (`a week of` 26 5 5) 10 EQUALS 15
